        },
        "gameplay": {
          "score": 7,
          "reason": "Recoveries, patrol cues, coil phases and uplink created a coherent short objective sequence. Most travel was assisted and uplink completed while standing under fire; tactical depth and continuous enjoyment are not established."
        },
        "presentation": {
          "score": 8,
          "reason": "Cohesive rain-soaked industrial scene, teal/amber language, readable weapon silhouette, clear target-down and coil feedback. Dark structural silhouettes can merge; no audio assessment."
        },
        "usability": {
          "score": 8,
          "reason": "Contextual hold button, objective checkmarks, paused planning map, clear fresh-start result panel and useful route/threat cues. Brief wall-facing route views and offscreen orientation add friction."
